Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add PHP's FFI extension

Symfony AI's TransformersPhp bridge runs the person detector through it.
---
 runtime/extensions/php-extensions.txt | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/runtime/extensions/php-extensions.txt b/runtime/extensions/php-extensions.txt
index c4516d3..56d10e6 100644
--- a/runtime/extensions/php-extensions.txt
+++ b/runtime/extensions/php-extensions.txt
@@ -51,3 +51,4 @@ xmlwriter        # simple_sitemap, which Drupal CMS site templates require
 yaml             # core InfoParserDynamic parses .info.yml with it, Symfony otherwise
 zip              # core Archiver; Composer unpacks dist archives in the build and drupack composer
 zlib             # Drupal core
+ffi              # symfony/ai TransformersPhp bridge
